  "description": "The supervisor clause carries ranges, never defaults (decision 5.36). create_worker's optional undialled_timeout bounds a worker no core ever dials — no connect will reach it, and E0 left such a worker running — and a v0.1 request without it stays valid: nothing is assumed in its place. kill_worker names its reap_timeout every time. Every create_worker a collection captures validates against the same shape.",
  "corpus": [
    "decision 5.36",
    "session model §11",
    "decision 5.13"
  ],
  "case": {
    "schema": "schemas/supervisor.schema.json#/$defs/request",
    "instances": [
      {
